# Sun Petal Kingdom — Cursor Rules

## Stack
Godot 4.2, GDScript. All scripts use .gd extension.

## GDScript conventions
- snake_case for variables and functions
- PascalCase for class names and node names
- Always add type hints (var speed: float = 5.0)
- Use @export for inspector-editable variables
- Use @onready for node references
- Define signals at the top of each script
- extends goes on line 1, class_name on line 2 (if needed)

## Project layout
- scenes/   — .tscn files
- scripts/  — .gd files (one per scene/node type)
- assets/   — art, audio, fonts
- ui/       — UI scenes only
- addons/   — third-party Godot plugins

## Godot 4 notes
- Node3D not Spatial (that's Godot 3)
- CharacterBody2D / CharacterBody3D for player movement
- Signals: signal jumped(height: float)
- Autoloads live in scripts/ with Singleton_ prefix
